            "review_title": "Review at Jeffrey’s Kitchen - Taiwanese Beef Noodle & Dumpling",
            "review_text": "Christina Yu\nVietnam43 contributions\n1\nAuthentic Taiwanese Beef Noodles & Dumplings\nAug 2019\nAlthough the restaurant has a simple decor, the taste of the beef noodle I tried is hardly simple. The beef is tender and braised in the right way, the broth aromatic and the noodle ( freshly made ) cooked perfectly. I also tried the pork and chives dumplings which is freshly made and juicy~works very well with the garlic chili sauce provided. It is very difficult to find an authentic Taiwanese bistro in HCM and this is one of the best and great value for money!. Jeffrey the owner is chatty and speaks very good English and have a chef licence from Taiwan. Most recipes are from his family. Will definitely go back and try dinner with friends so that I can try more dishes. The bistro apparently closes at 11pm and so a great place to go for a hearty dinner after the movie session.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 23, 2019\nTam Le\nThank you 😊\nWritten March 10, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
